  "scopeLimits": [
    "Three POST structure-creation routes only; grants, invitations, other handlers, shared helpers, policies and migrations are unchanged.",
    "Required administrative actors establish MFA through real HTTP login/enrollment/TOTP in the same family; optional local controls use ordinary login. Negative fixture SQL removes factor/proof only.",
    "Six failures are after the real separate manage authorization; one is after a narrow audit trigger for teams. A sequence proves the trigger ran once and the fixed test compares exact original proof timestamp text, generation and presence after rollback.",
    "Full POST DTOs/defaults/dates and allowed nulls are checked; units/teams include metadata and blocks does not. The original floor:null contract is preserved.",
    "Directed cases do not induce real row-lock waits, promotion, capability-loss waits, concurrent constraints, a zero-row INSERT or a generic audit-trigger exception; these remain pending.",
    "The separate PATCH and revocation regressions retain their own scopes; their PASS does not add unexecuted creation scenarios.",
    "Owned process checks cover the controller's registered direct children; no universal census of other projects or descendant processes is claimed.",
    "Native UTC timestamps remain unchanged; their calendar date need not match the Sao Paulo review/document date.",
    "No browser, Android/iOS, whole API, performance or production acceptance is asserted."
  ],
